        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How does SEO increase sales for an e-commerce apparel store?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Apparel SEO optimizes category pages, product listings, schema markup, and high-volume fashion search terms (e.g., 'designer ethnic wear', 'sustainable cotton shirts'). This ranks your catalog on page 1 of Google, driving consistent organic shopping traffic without relying solely on paid ad budgets."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What paid ad channels yield the highest ROAS for clothing brands?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Meta Ads (Instagram Reels, Feed, & Carousel Ads) and Google Shopping/Performance Max Ads consistently deliver the highest return on ad spend (ROAS) for apparel. Meta drives visual discovery and emotional buying, while Google Shopping captures users actively searching to purchase specific apparel items."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you reduce high cart abandonment rates for fashion stores?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We deploy automated multi-touch recovery funnels via SMS, WhatsApp Business, and Klaviyo/Omnisend email sequences. Combined with dynamic Meta retargeting ads showing abandoned cart items, we recover 25% to 38% of lost apparel sales."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you manage influencer marketing and User Generated Content (UGC)?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes! We partner with micro and macro fashion influencers to create try-on haul Reels, style lookbooks, and authentic unboxing videos. This UGC is integrated directly into social ad campaigns and store product pages to build social proof and boost conversion rates."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you help new clothing brands launch online D2C stores?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Absolutely. We build high-converting, mobile-optimized D2C e-commerce stores on Shopify and WooCommerce, set up payment gateways, integrate product feed catalogs, and create complete launch campaigns to drive immediate sales."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you optimize apparel Google Shopping product feeds?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We structure Google Merchant Center feeds with precise GTIN/MPN codes, rich color/size attributes, high-resolution lifestyle images, and search-optimized product titles to maximize impression share and click-through rates on Google Shopping auctions."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is the average timeline to see results from apparel digital marketing?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Paid Meta Ads and Google Shopping campaigns start generating traffic and sales within 24-48 hours of launch. E-commerce SEO and organic search scaling typically show significant revenue impact within 60 to 90 days."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you handle seasonal inventory launches and holiday clearance sales?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We plan pre-launch VIP teaser campaigns, flash sale landing pages, countdown email sequences, and high-budget push campaigns for festive seasons (Diwali, Black Friday, New Year, Summer/Winter collections) to clear inventory rapidly."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you provide custom apparel photography and ad creative services?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes, our creative team designs eye-catching ad graphics, motion reels, video banners, and promotional templates tailored specifically for fashion brand visual aesthetics."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you reduce apparel return rates through digital marketing?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We optimize product page descriptions with detailed sizing charts, fit guides, fabric care details, real customer reviews, and high-definition video walkthroughs to ensure buyers choose the exact right size and style."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you track exact online sales revenue generated by ad campaigns?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes! We implement Google Analytics 4 (GA4) Enhanced E-commerce Tracking, Meta Conversions API (CAPI), and Shopify pixel integration to track exact revenue, order value, ROAS, and customer lifetime value (LTV) in real time."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you support international shipping and global apparel marketing?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes, we run multi-currency international ad campaigns, cross-border SEO, and localized ad copy to help Indian clothing brands export to buyers across the US, UK, UAE, Canada, and Australia."
